index 0236ad0..20208eb 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: `wo close` on a closed work order closed it again, moving its close date and recording its services twice; it now fails with `E126`.
 - Work orders carry a shop supplies charge: `shop_supplies_percent` (5) of the labour, capped at `shop_supplies_cap` (40.00); `wo show` lists it as `supplies` and counts it in `total`.
 - New `critical` status for services overdue by more than `critical_miles` (1000) miles or `critical_days` (30) days; critical services lead the due list.
 - Parts stock: `parts receive`, `parts count` and `parts stock`; a stocked part is charged at its average cost.
